<title>INDIA: INDIA'S CARE RETAINS THE RATING OF FSBCL.</title>
<headline>INDIA'S CARE RETAINS THE RATING OF FSBCL.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Analysis &amp; Research Ltd.(CARE) said on Thursday in a statement that it has retained the rating for the fixed deposit programme of Five Star Business Credits Ltd. (FSBCL) at CARE BBB(FD) for a limit of 55 million rupees.</p>
<p>FSBCL is a small Chennai based NBFC, primarily engaged in leasing and hire purchase and short term lending. During 1996/97 (April-March), the company's operational performance improved marginally over the previous year.</p>
</text>
